  "description": "The greatest bean dinner is called the bandeja paisa: Beans, rice, arepas, fried green or black plantains, avocado, a thin slice of grilled steak, deep fried pork rinds (known as chicharrones), a chorizo or two, a side of ají to sauce everything up, and a fried egg to top it off.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 11 hr 20 min.\n\nOptional substitutions: Fried sweet → starchy plantains",
